==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:A Deal with a Dust Devil]] in order to do [[Quest:Fixing Up a Sweet Ride]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Golmie Greasebeard]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Watch Golmie's back while he finishes the repairs on Dorn's motorcycle.
*Defend Golmie Greasebeard
*Talk to Golmie Greasebeard
*Talk to Dorn Geargrinder
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Golmie Greasebeard]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"I got most of the repairs done, but it’s hard to do with all of the <font color='#D9781A'>Skullz</font> gettin' in the way. They been tryin' their best to keep Dorn off the track. It’s like they know they’ll lose in a race against a real biker." -Golmie Greasebeard
#Defend [[Golmie Greasebeard]] from 3 waves of [[Skullz Thug]].
#Speak with [[Golmie Greasebeard]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Thanks for getting' my back. Go let Dorn know that his bike's ready whenever he is." -Golmie Greasebeard
#Speak with [[Dorn Geargrinder]] located in [[Rumble Ridge]], [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"It'll be good to get back on the old hog again. Thanks, <"Player Name">." -Dorn Geargrinder
